   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Get a Little Taste Of You**: back after 51 archived shows (1070 days) [3]\n- **Don't Get To Close To My Fantasy**: back after 65 archived shows (1271 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Mister, Would You Plese Help My Pony?**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **HIV**: back after 55 archived shows (1188 days) [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Laura [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1998-05-08.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 136 min [1]\n- **Ween1998-05-08**: source not stated; 25 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Bobby Ogdin is noted as playing piano, marked with an asterisk, on the tracks flagged in the notes [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1998-05-08.flac**: taped by Stymie; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Audio-Technica 822 > Sony SBM-1 > Sony D-8 @ 16/48 [1]\n- **Ween1998-05-08**: Recorded with Audio Technica 822 mics into a Sony SBM-01 and Sony TCD-08 DAT recorder; Transfer chain went from DAT through a Panasonic SV-3800 by optical link to a Mac Mini, using Audacity at 48k, then FLAC [2]",
